WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple, Hazelnut

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.550
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:08.590
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.630
Oh, mommies! What to do?
This is a priceless book.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:12.630
Episode 16

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:30.210
Why did you say this book is priceless?

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:36.250
Why is Primary Instruction for Children valuable to you?

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.820
-This is...
-Was it you?

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:44.320
The one who saved me was you?

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:46.790
Did you save me from the well?

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.840
Yes. It was me.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:05.980
Have you forgotten about everything?

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:08.250
Yes, I dragged you on my hump.

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:12.020
My arms are still falling off.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.920
I can't believe you forgot about everything.
You don’t remember anything good at all.

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:18.730
No, I'm talking about the events of eight years ago.

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:20.890
So this isn't the first time you've fallen into a well?

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:23.930
Don't you look around at all?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.640
Then why is this book so priceless?

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:33.870
Looks like one of the true masterpieces.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:37.980
You're talking nonsense again.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.820
Waking up from a nightmare
like I was locked in a well,

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.320
I immediately thought of you.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.390
I decided it was because
that you helped me get out,

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.790
but since then I have become

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.890
notice how similar you are
to the girl who saved me.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:57.960
Thought it might be you.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:04.270
If the noodles swell,
it won't taste good.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:06.670
Will you?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.180
Bon appetit.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.350
Cutie.

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:23.320
Blow to cool it down, and don’t be in such a hurry.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.900
What's so interesting about you?

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.470
A textbook on tactics from the Ming Dynasty.

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:37.940
A tactics manual?

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:39.840
Military tactics?

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.480
Are you planning to start a war?

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:44.840
If I want to strengthen my power,

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.850
I will need the support of the army.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.720
Still have nightmares about

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.090
How can you die without achieving anything?

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:54.690
From case to case.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:04.930
If this happens,
it's not because you're stupid.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:07.170
This was how it was originally intended.

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:11.170
It's just that you were unlucky.

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:12.340
It's not your fault.

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:14.410
Maybe you're right.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:18.880
So stop torturing yourself like this.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.810
You still can't

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.380
interfere with fate.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:30.020
Sometimes I wake up from a nightmare,

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.160
and strange thoughts come to mind.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.560
That this dream is real,

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.170
and we live in the past.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:49.880
It's like it's all my vision

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.010
just before death.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:57.450
And at this very moment

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:03.960
I have a chance to do something, to fix everything.

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:10.100
Quite possible now

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:15.640
I do everything to resist fate.

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:29.420
For this man whose destiny is to lose,
I wanted to sacrifice everything.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.760
All-in

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:47.170
You will definitely defeat them all.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.700
I'm always on the winning side.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.740
And while I'm around,
victory is yours.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:59.550
Your attitude is very encouraging.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.120
I have a secret weapon.

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:05.590
I know the future.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.660
Do you remember?

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:10.290
As I said,
that I'm a man from the distant future?

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:12.860
Of course I remember.
This is hard to forget.

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.790
What if it's true

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.100
and I will share my knowledge with you?

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:21.370
Do you think I'll believe this?

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:23.840
In that case,

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:28.710
think I had a dream.
Useful prophetic dream.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:32.080
Rave.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:40.450
Since it's just a dream,
I won't believe your stories,

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:42.490
but I'll be happy to listen.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:45.230
What is Joseon like 200 years later?

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:47.390
Well.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.630
This is just a story I made up,

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:56.240
but we no longer call our country Joseon.

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:59.940
Republic of Korea.
This is what Joseon is waiting for.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:02.940
Republic of Korea?

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:05.880
In this country people choose for themselves
who will rule.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.550
What nonsense.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:11.890
Tell me something more believable so that I believe.

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:13.750
If you don't believe me now,
we have problems.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.690
This is just my invention.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:20.030
200 years later there are no nobles and commoners.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:23.300
Are people no longer divided into classes?

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.630
Well, people have come up with something new.

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:28.430
Are you a money bag or not?

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:32.410
Does a person's status determine his bag?

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.340
So, does everyone choose a ruler using a bag?

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.780
This is called voting.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:40.650
When you turn 18,

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:44.120
you can choose your rulers.

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:47.120
-Choose rulers?
-Yeah.

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.590
Why exactly at 18?

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:57.630
This is how the Queen's day went.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.370
Well done.

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:10.680
Now watch her every move.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.120
Byonin,

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:27.690
we have you now
youngest minister of war

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.100
and became even more attractive.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:31.800
Do you really think so?

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:34.170
- Of course not.
- I knew it.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.440
Congratulations!

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:47.510
By the way, Benin,

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.480
our family doesn't care at all

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:52.850
can't you get along with the king?

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.960
He is very important to the queen

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.060
and he doesn’t look like a bad person.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:01.590
All his sympathy for the queen is a lie.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:07.030
For your own benefit
he will always risk her life.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.800
I wouldn't say that.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.640
This is what infuriates him the most.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:15.410
Hides behind masks and women.

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:19.150
Acts two-faced
and treacherously deceives everyone around.

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:22.480
The queen also succumbed to his charms,

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.950
and now for the sake of the king
ready to give up my family.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.450
However, the king is only using her.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:32.030
But I heard that it was the queen

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:33.730
twists the king as he wants.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.530
And who, who

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:39.600
so the servants know best
about the king's personal life.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:44.770
They say they last night until dawn

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:49.110
chatted in the king's chambers.

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:17.200
If Cheoljong fails,

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.140
Will the world also change after 200 years?

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.280
And then there will be no Japanese annexation,

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.810
and that bastard Director Han will not be born.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:29.950
All this is not for Cheoljong.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:32.990
I'm doing this for myself.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.360
Helping you

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.290
I'm saving myself.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:52.810
Your Majesty!

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:58.010
Your Majesty!
Your father fell unconscious!

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:04.850
What a nightmare.

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.790
Don't get up!

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.230
-What's happened?
-It's dangerous here.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.330
Why did you come?

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:21.700
No! It's much more dangerous in the palace.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.340
Queen, stay home.

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:28.940
I will do anything to protect you.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.250
You must have fainted
out of concern for me.

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.880
It's my fault.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:41.090
It's as if I personally fed you this poison.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:45.190
I wrote that stupid book
and didn't follow her.

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:47.560
It was they who did the wrong thing.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.030
This is not your fault, so stop.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.370
Better take care of your health.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.900
I'm as healthy as an ox.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:00.740
As long as you're happy, I'm happy too.

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:03.510
Therefore, honey,

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.350
give up the title of queen.

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:10.920
-Dad.
-Soyeon.

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:14.490
When your mother was pregnant

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:17.060
she always repeated something.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.730
She wanted her child
was much happier than she was.

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:24.460
So that you can live
her life in a way she couldn't.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.300
To make your life better
than your mother's.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:30.840
This was her last wish.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:33.070
Because after death

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:36.110
Can I look your mother in the eyes?

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:39.850
Dad.

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:44.580
I will definitely fulfill my mother's wish.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:48.860
I will take revenge on them for everything
what they did to me.

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.090
Queen!

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:53.460
So you can't get sick for anything.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.370
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:04.140
I'm listening. You can ask for anything.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.870
I will do everything.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.110
Sale from stock

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:13.950
The owner has gone crazy!

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:17.980
In my life I would never have thought that he was like this!

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:21.220
What if they force you to pay later?
twice as much?

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:22.260
What?

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.490
Thank you!

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:27.130
Mister Kim! Your Majesty!

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:29.700
Long life to you!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.300
Did you sell him a bag of rice?

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.770
Just flew like a cuckoo!

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:38.370
The gentleman has lost his mind!

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.640
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.510
Forget about corruption

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:48.980
take care of your reputation.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:55.190
Are you sure you want to sell all this to the people?

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:56.190
Exactly!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:59.990
I can’t drag all this to the grave.

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:11.340
Sorry, won't you let me go?

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:16.740
Greed is a bad habit.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.720
Your father has made an important decision.

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:31.820
And that's not all.

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:37.160
You were looking for the ledger.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:39.500
Dad remembers everything that was written in it.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.740
Not ministers, but cesspool rats.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:48.810
The left adviser carried out fraud with grain.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:51.010
In various ways he appropriated

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:52.810
a huge amount of it.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.080
The chief adviser warmed his hands on the lands.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.250
For example, he will slip someone a quarry and force them to work in it,

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:02.760
and then crush you with exorbitant taxes.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:06.390
There is no one who does not steal

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:07.560
and there is nothing that is not stolen.

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:10.030
And also military corruption and the purchase of positions.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.100
Instead of sending a boat with salt,

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.500
they filled it with stones and drowned it,

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.030
and they took the salt for themselves.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.870
Similar tricks were performed with gifts for the king.

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.240
And in the midst of it all,
who pissed me off more?

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:22.140
so these are moneylenders.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:24.080
They raised taxes on the peasants,

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.810
and then lent them money at 5%.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.180
So the debts will grow with every breath.

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:31.820
Behavior like gangsters.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.590
Your father's memory regarding profit

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:37.090
really impressive.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:40.790
By the way, tell me

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:44.100
How do you deal with an informant?

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:48.930
Your father was a key figure in all these machinations.

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.900
His crimes won't go away like that.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:55.510
-However...
-What is “however”?

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:58.440
Your father is just another corrupt criminal to me.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:02.680
However

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:06.250
he is your only blood relative.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.860
What if so?

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:15.060
They say

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:16.200
that there are many merits

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.730
can justify shortcomings.

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:20.670
Does he need more credit?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.070
For example?

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:23.470
For example,

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:26.510
he can help get evidence.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:31.140
It's hard to punish them with just a ledger.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:35.150
In return you guarantee protection

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:37.120
informant.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:38.650
Certainly.

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:48.090
Your Majesty, it's time for the royal council.

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:49.600
Fine.

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:57.540
Royal council?

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:02.980
If you want to burn garbage, go to a landfill.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.880
Only, except for the regent - the dowager queen,

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.450
Women are not allowed to enter there.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:11.450
I nominate my brother, Prince Yeonpyeong,

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.090
head of Ijeongcheon.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.220
-You shouldn’t do that.
-You shouldn’t do that.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.260
Why is this?

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:22.190
This kind of work and responsibility is too great

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:25.430
for such an inexperienced young man,
as Prince Yeonpyeong, he won't cope.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.440
On the contrary, he is not associated with anyone powerful.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:34.270
This is the highest virtue for ruling Ijeongcheon.

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:36.480
In addition,

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:41.850
does it look like I'm asking you now?

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:49.890
You're burning, Cheoljong.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:55.490
I sent a secret inspector to Yeongnam.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:58.060
Perpetrators of abuse of power

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.700
will be punished in accordance with the law.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:01.600
Everything they misappropriated

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.400
will be used to help the people.

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:08.810
This will be an example for our eight governors

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.310
and make them confess.

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:14.310
-We object, Your Majesty.
-We object, Your Majesty.

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:19.120
The Minister of War has already sent military leaders there.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:22.820
Were they sent without my permission?

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.620
Lately

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.930
heinous incidents perpetrated by the followers of Donghak,

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.790
reminiscent of the uprisings that used to be

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.160
threatened the sovereignty of Joseon.

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:34.870
There was a crisis, and it requires quick solutions.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:36.940
I am sure that the border agency does what it wants.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.580
Followers of Donghak rioted

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.410
and threatened civil servants.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:48.780
As a result, they caused harm to officials.

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:53.650
We had to quickly capture and punish the gang leader.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.420
To avoid repetition,

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.620
the source of evil had to be eradicated.

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:01.130
Eliminate the source of evil?

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:03.000
We captured, imprisoned and punished

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:06.970
followers and disseminators of the Tonhak teachings.

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:10.200
Blame all Joseon's problems

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.000
to a gang of bandits!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:14.010
To eradicate the true source of evil,

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:16.840
I will allow Ijeongcheon to conduct an investigation in the interests of the people!

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.380
Sitting on the throne

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.110
the essence of the people cannot be understood.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:25.750
Once you start fulfilling their demands, there will be no end to it.

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:28.450
We must suppress them by force,

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.220
to ensure that uprisings do not happen again.

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:35.060
-We agree, Your Majesty.
-We agree, Your Majesty.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.340
I'll check all the prisoners to make sure

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:49.140
that among them there are no innocent victims of lawlessness.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:52.610
In addition, I will severely punish the bandits,

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:54.710
so that there is an example for everyone.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.780
And I will order to punish the governors and military leaders,

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.050
those responsible for our troubles.

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:18.600
He wants to suppress the uprising only with the help of the law.

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.370
How naive.

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:25.810
Before the rebellion gets out of control,

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:29.010
I will send troops and subdue the followers of Tonhak.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.550
What are you doing?

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:35.450
Apply the elixir before my face gets dry.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:39.530
Your Majesty, it's over.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:48.230
Should I ask the Queen to do more?

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:49.770
Not worth it.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.570
Of course not. Forget what I said.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:53.440
-You can go.
-Yes.

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:08.290
Still can't forgive the queen?

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.420
I would read her correspondence with the king,

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:12.360
I wouldn't ask.

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:14.730
Forgiveness will not solve the problem.

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:17.700
Their love letters are nothing but nonsense.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.970
They even wanted to give their lives for each other.

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:42.920
And this is the reward for my devotion to your family?

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:45.020
You set up my family and we were exiled.

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:46.290
Made us look like rebels

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:47.530
and deprived of the future.

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.800
How could you leave us to our fate?

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:54.900
Consider yourself lucky that you weren't executed.

00:21:56.470 --> 00:22:00.210
At least your family is alive.

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:14.950
Come work for me in the palace.

00:22:16.490 --> 00:22:17.990
I will prove

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:20.960
that I am different from my father.

00:22:31.300 --> 00:22:32.400
Booze tastes best during the day.

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:33.510
Certainly.

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:37.540
Drinking in the middle of the day.

00:22:39.110 --> 00:22:42.410
Oh, shrimp. Rare product.

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:48.820
-Who are you?
-Who are you?

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:51.190
Drink here all day.

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:54.190
What? How dare you talk to me like that?

00:22:54.660 --> 00:22:56.530
Who are you anyway?

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:58.800
Let me introduce myself.

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:02.740
Yeah.

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:04.640
I'm a secret inspector.

00:23:09.310 --> 00:23:10.640
Oh, that's how it should be.

00:23:14.110 --> 00:23:17.520
I heard that these days there are fake secret inspectors here.

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:19.220
I'm not buying your trick.

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:23.020
The token no longer has the same power as before.

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:34.870
The secret inspector arrived.

00:23:35.500 --> 00:23:37.470
Have mercy.

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:42.040
These days, a gun works more reliably than a badge.

00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:52.380
Here's a thorn.

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:54.520
We are men. We don't serve tea with sweets.

00:23:56.290 --> 00:23:58.490
I wonder why she called us.

00:23:58.490 --> 00:24:01.730
The king uses a whip. And the queen is a gingerbread.

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:03.700
Perhaps this is their plan.

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:08.500
He probably wants to show that we are from the same clan.

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:10.400
But it won't work.

00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:13.670
We can just play along.

00:24:14.770 --> 00:24:16.710
-Certainly.
- Let's go.

00:24:21.050 --> 00:24:23.450
Quite a long time has passed since my accession to the throne.

00:24:23.920 --> 00:24:26.820
But I never invited my clan to the feast.

00:24:27.890 --> 00:24:29.720
I've been very busy lately.

00:24:30.690 --> 00:24:31.990
Please forgive me.

00:24:37.030 --> 00:24:39.360
It's sparse here, but I cooked for you myself.

00:24:40.600 --> 00:24:41.700
Enjoy.

00:24:51.840 --> 00:24:54.450
This is wine, not tea.

00:24:55.850 --> 00:24:57.320
Pretend it's tea.

00:24:57.320 --> 00:24:59.520
The king ordered the number of dishes to be reduced.

00:24:59.650 --> 00:25:02.250
How else could his subjects get together and drink?

00:25:02.550 --> 00:25:03.690
But if he finds out...

00:25:15.030 --> 00:25:18.200
You deceived us, Your Majesty.

00:25:18.740 --> 00:25:21.040
Did you set us up?

00:25:21.140 --> 00:25:23.140
-Incredible.
-How could she?

00:25:25.380 --> 00:25:28.110
Stop making me angry. Spoil the mood.

00:25:28.850 --> 00:25:31.150
But it was you who angered us.

00:25:31.150 --> 00:25:34.620
What? Who do you take us for?

00:25:36.020 --> 00:25:39.790
I know exactly who you are.

00:25:41.560 --> 00:25:43.900
You are the evil of this society.

00:25:44.600 --> 00:25:46.830
-Evil?
-Evil?

00:25:48.330 --> 00:25:53.010
In your language, you are the plague of this era.

00:25:53.010 --> 00:25:54.810
-What?
-What?

00:25:54.810 --> 00:25:57.340
Why should we tolerate such treatment?

00:25:57.680 --> 00:25:58.840
Let's leave.

00:25:59.480 --> 00:26:01.310
Why did you do this to us?

00:26:02.410 --> 00:26:04.520
Good question. Glad you asked.

00:26:05.180 --> 00:26:07.620
No wonder the chief adviser, you are very smart.

00:26:07.620 --> 00:26:08.750
What...

00:26:09.660 --> 00:26:11.660
Are you asking why I did this?

00:26:12.820 --> 00:26:17.660
I'm trying to tell you not to get in the king's way.

00:26:19.600 --> 00:26:23.170
You will oppose his ideas,

00:26:23.870 --> 00:26:27.070
know that I will come from the back and at a time

00:26:27.070 --> 00:26:29.470
I'll kill everyone.

00:26:30.710 --> 00:26:31.940
Consider yourself warned.

00:26:40.250 --> 00:26:42.020
If your goal is to create lawlessness,

00:26:42.020 --> 00:26:44.190
hiding behind the clan,

00:26:45.690 --> 00:26:48.290
be alert.

00:26:49.060 --> 00:26:51.060
Queen, you are also one of the Andonian Kims.

00:26:51.060 --> 00:26:53.800
Therefore, I decided to change my last name.

00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:56.470
Now I'm not Kim Soyeon. I'm Chan Soyeon.

00:26:56.470 --> 00:26:59.170
-What?
-What the hell...

00:27:01.140 --> 00:27:04.380
They are probably so dense because the clan helped them get positions.

00:27:04.380 --> 00:27:05.610
Hack yourself on your nose.

00:27:05.610 --> 00:27:07.450
No more objections.

00:27:07.810 --> 00:27:09.720
No arguments. No collusion.

00:27:09.720 --> 00:27:11.180
No trekking to Okthajeong.

00:27:11.180 --> 00:27:13.250
What does Oktajeong have to do with it?

00:27:14.520 --> 00:27:15.820
Well, I can’t go.

00:27:18.020 --> 00:27:20.870
The order was carried out without any problems.

00:27:22.170 --> 00:27:26.610
The Queen Dowager saw to it.

00:27:29.000 --> 00:27:31.430
I came today with a request.

00:27:32.810 --> 00:27:35.310
Now that you have united with my clan,

00:27:35.310 --> 00:27:38.620
don't threaten or harm the queen anymore,

00:27:38.740 --> 00:27:40.240
she is also from our clan.

00:27:43.280 --> 00:27:45.160
Our enemy is the king.

00:27:46.420 --> 00:27:50.630
Threatening each other with swords
we will only help the enemy.

00:27:51.860 --> 00:27:53.670
Agree.

00:27:53.670 --> 00:27:57.800
No more shamanic rituals and talismans. I abandoned them.

00:28:01.930 --> 00:28:05.310
-Your Majesty.
-I have something to tell you.

00:28:16.620 --> 00:28:18.820
Yes, I must read books of this time,

00:28:18.820 --> 00:28:20.390
to better understand the language.

00:28:20.830 --> 00:28:23.130
It's hard to swear in a friendly manner.

00:28:24.020 --> 00:28:27.460
Where can I read about Joseon slang words?

00:28:27.460 --> 00:28:30.430
There are no such books in this library.

00:28:30.800 --> 00:28:31.960
Where is it?

00:28:32.140 --> 00:28:34.640
Turn to novels

00:28:34.640 --> 00:28:36.770
sold in a shop outside the palace.

00:28:38.000 --> 00:28:39.200
What are they about?

00:28:39.970 --> 00:28:43.880
I've heard about them. But I never read it.

00:28:44.820 --> 00:28:46.240
I know a few.

00:28:47.710 --> 00:28:49.180
About a faithful wife,

00:28:49.180 --> 00:28:51.010
who died after her husband's betrayal.

00:28:51.010 --> 00:28:53.560
Her spirit came back with a mole near her mouth,

00:28:53.560 --> 00:28:54.980
to take revenge.

00:28:56.160 --> 00:28:57.800
What a familiar story.

00:28:57.860 --> 00:28:59.060
What is the name of the book?

00:28:59.130 --> 00:29:00.490
"Temptation of the Wife."

00:29:01.900 --> 00:29:02.990
You didn't read it.

00:29:03.100 --> 00:29:06.100
I only know the name.

00:29:07.700 --> 00:29:09.410
What else? What else?

00:29:09.670 --> 00:29:11.000
This one came out recently.

00:29:11.000 --> 00:29:12.640
About the noble madam.

00:29:12.640 --> 00:29:15.670
Her husband started an affair with a neighbor's daughter.

00:29:15.670 --> 00:29:17.320
"The World of a Married Couple"

00:29:19.380 --> 00:29:22.240
Lady Choi, why are you so worried, haven’t you read it?

00:29:23.120 --> 00:29:24.560
I'm sorry.

00:29:26.420 --> 00:29:29.450
All women react the same way to such stories.

00:29:35.720 --> 00:29:37.190
Why did you do this?

00:29:38.460 --> 00:29:39.760
Leave us alone.

00:29:42.070 --> 00:29:43.140
Yes.

00:29:49.440 --> 00:29:52.620
You need the support of the clan to ensure your safety.

00:29:53.050 --> 00:29:55.120
Why ruin your relationship with them?

00:29:55.510 --> 00:29:56.950
It seems you forgot

00:29:56.980 --> 00:29:59.450
that these old men were trying to kill me.

00:29:59.450 --> 00:30:01.720
I do my best to build bridges,

00:30:01.720 --> 00:30:03.450
so you can return.

00:30:03.450 --> 00:30:05.130
I don't want to go back.

00:30:06.490 --> 00:30:07.960
I went all out

00:30:07.960 --> 00:30:10.460
to woo the Queen Dowager.

00:30:10.460 --> 00:30:12.930
I didn’t work so hard even in the Blue House.

00:30:14.730 --> 00:30:16.200
And what did I get in response?

00:30:16.580 --> 00:30:17.700
Poisoned ice.

00:30:17.700 --> 00:30:19.850
This is because of rumors spread by the Cho Clan.

00:30:20.550 --> 00:30:22.740
I will keep you safe.

00:30:23.270 --> 00:30:24.970
Let's be clear.

00:30:24.970 --> 00:30:26.940
Better sooner than later.

00:30:28.010 --> 00:30:30.390
I won't return your feelings

00:30:30.390 --> 00:30:32.280
and I can't use them.

00:30:32.780 --> 00:30:33.860
I

00:30:35.560 --> 00:30:37.420
chose a different path

00:30:37.800 --> 00:30:39.900
It's better for us to each go our own way.

00:30:43.840 --> 00:30:45.870
I belong to you, Your Majesty.

00:30:51.970 --> 00:30:53.850
Why the king?

00:30:54.410 --> 00:30:57.120
If he disappears, I'll do anything

00:30:57.120 --> 00:30:59.580
whatever you ask. Why him?

00:31:04.820 --> 00:31:06.720
It's not about him.

00:31:07.890 --> 00:31:09.920
I have no feelings for you.

00:31:23.030 --> 00:31:25.310
Don't let go of my hand, Soyeon.

00:31:28.110 --> 00:31:29.880
You are everything to me.

00:32:11.710 --> 00:32:13.450
You must portray

00:32:13.450 --> 00:32:15.180
everything is detailed, every strand of hair.

00:32:16.250 --> 00:32:18.130
Reflect not only the appearance,

00:32:18.130 --> 00:32:19.660
but also inner strength and dignity.

00:32:19.660 --> 00:32:21.800
Don't use your own style.

00:32:31.170 --> 00:32:32.270
My queen.

00:32:33.240 --> 00:32:35.110
Are you worried about something?

00:32:36.310 --> 00:32:37.550
No, I wouldn't say that.

00:32:39.270 --> 00:32:41.180
I don't feel well.

00:32:44.510 --> 00:32:45.750
My queen.

00:32:50.100 --> 00:32:51.400
What came over you?

00:32:52.900 --> 00:32:55.670
When I smile like that, my voice sounds royal.

00:32:55.670 --> 00:32:58.990
And when the eyes cross, the voice sounds like a eunuch.

00:33:03.880 --> 00:33:05.270
Isn't it funny?

00:33:05.970 --> 00:33:09.240
It's very difficult to make you laugh.

00:33:09.580 --> 00:33:10.670
Then...

00:33:11.550 --> 00:33:14.350
When I bend down, I speak like a servant.

00:33:14.350 --> 00:33:17.920
And when I stand up straight, I speak like a warrior.

00:33:17.920 --> 00:33:19.390
Isn't it funny?

00:33:27.830 --> 00:33:29.130
You laugh.

00:33:30.230 --> 00:33:31.370
Your Majesty.

00:33:31.690 --> 00:33:34.000
-Take your pose.
-Fine.

00:33:35.110 --> 00:33:36.730
I'll make you laugh later.

00:33:39.310 --> 00:33:42.080
By the way, why do you need this portrait?

00:33:42.080 --> 00:33:44.350
According to the rule of "Cho" and "Chon",

00:33:44.350 --> 00:33:46.650
King Seongjong will be called Sunjo with honor,

00:33:48.650 --> 00:33:51.210
that means they will respect me too,

00:33:51.210 --> 00:33:52.750
for wanting to honor his memory.

00:33:52.750 --> 00:33:55.160
Rule "Cho" and "Chon"...

00:33:55.330 --> 00:33:57.660
I've heard about him.

00:33:57.920 --> 00:34:00.260
When choosing a posthumous name for a king

00:34:00.260 --> 00:34:02.720
"Cho" is used for those who have made a great contribution,

00:34:02.720 --> 00:34:05.190
and "Chon" for those who have become famous for virtue.

00:34:06.340 --> 00:34:07.740
That's right, now I remember.

00:34:13.700 --> 00:34:15.780
Your Majesty, I brought what you asked for.

00:34:16.680 --> 00:34:18.340
Let's see.

00:34:26.320 --> 00:34:28.130
Looks great.

00:34:28.130 --> 00:34:30.090
Do you want to learn fencing?

00:34:30.400 --> 00:34:31.720
I'm good at it.

00:34:32.360 --> 00:34:34.470
I don't even need to study.

00:34:34.670 --> 00:34:36.590
I'm the best with knives.

00:34:37.200 --> 00:34:41.760
This is a gift for a special person.

00:34:43.610 --> 00:34:44.880
Special?

00:35:07.260 --> 00:35:08.590
My turn?

00:35:08.970 --> 00:35:10.430
So are you waiting for this?

00:35:10.670 --> 00:35:12.070
Well, sorry.

00:35:12.400 --> 00:35:14.510
You were kicked out

00:35:14.510 --> 00:35:17.030
I wasn't sure it was worth bothering with you.

00:35:17.970 --> 00:35:19.180
It's funny.

00:35:20.280 --> 00:35:21.950
You proposed an alliance,

00:35:21.950 --> 00:35:23.610
but they left without saying goodbye.

00:35:23.680 --> 00:35:25.920
You couldn't keep your husband under control.

00:35:25.920 --> 00:35:28.820
Is that why you didn't ensure my safety?

00:35:32.220 --> 00:35:34.260
You see, I had a plan.

00:35:34.260 --> 00:35:36.220
Until you challenged me.

00:35:36.590 --> 00:35:38.430
What's the idea?

00:35:38.430 --> 00:35:40.970
Live a quiet, boring life.

00:35:44.630 --> 00:35:45.860
Draw your sword.

00:35:47.800 --> 00:35:50.510
I don't fight women.

00:35:52.800 --> 00:35:55.680
This is a gift on the occasion of his removal from office.

00:35:57.110 --> 00:36:01.280
All your achievements are marked on the blade,

00:36:02.220 --> 00:36:03.510
look.

00:36:11.820 --> 00:36:15.220
This is the life you led.

00:36:17.090 --> 00:36:18.570
You said that I'm good for nothing

00:36:19.090 --> 00:36:22.610
I can't because I'm a woman, not a queen.

00:36:23.840 --> 00:36:26.470
Wait. I will show my abilities.

00:36:27.780 --> 00:36:30.320
No more obstacles to my words or deeds,

00:36:30.650 --> 00:36:32.180
because I have nothing to lose.

00:36:49.200 --> 00:36:52.200
Your Majesty, the main concubine has arrived.

00:36:53.430 --> 00:36:54.630
Let him come in.

00:37:08.840 --> 00:37:10.260
How are you feeling?

00:37:13.050 --> 00:37:16.050
I organized my thoughts while I was shooting my bow.

00:37:16.050 --> 00:37:17.820
I found peace.

00:37:19.050 --> 00:37:20.130
Glad to hear that.

00:37:21.900 --> 00:37:24.090
It's late and you still have a lot of work to do.

00:37:24.090 --> 00:37:26.130
Don't worry about it.

00:37:32.840 --> 00:37:34.340
Initial Instruction for Children

00:37:47.490 --> 00:37:50.320
If I knew how much you would treasure this book,

00:37:50.800 --> 00:37:52.490
I would try to leave it clean.

00:37:53.490 --> 00:37:54.930
Look at these doodles.

00:38:02.800 --> 00:38:05.530
It seems you are busy. I've taken up too much time.

00:38:05.530 --> 00:38:06.630
I'll go.

00:38:12.220 --> 00:38:13.280
Concubine.

00:38:15.490 --> 00:38:17.820
I didn't have time to say something.

00:38:20.260 --> 00:38:21.720
I liked you

00:38:23.380 --> 00:38:25.450
not only because of the meeting at the well

00:38:25.450 --> 00:38:27.430
eight years ago.

00:38:28.530 --> 00:38:30.630
When I returned to Hanyang and met you,

00:38:31.860 --> 00:38:33.260
I liked you.

00:38:38.340 --> 00:38:40.800
Your Majesty, Prince Yeonpyeong has arrived.

00:38:46.470 --> 00:38:48.740
Didn't know you were here.

00:38:48.920 --> 00:38:50.280
I was about to leave.

00:38:51.680 --> 00:38:53.180
I'll leave you.

00:39:06.240 --> 00:39:08.400
What were you talking about?

00:39:11.180 --> 00:39:13.340
Turn away from the truth that no one needs,

00:39:14.970 --> 00:39:16.700
it would be more correct.

00:39:47.450 --> 00:39:49.400
Eyes full of passion.

00:39:51.110 --> 00:39:53.880
So passionate about social sciences.

00:39:58.760 --> 00:40:00.880
You've been waiting for my lesson all day.

00:40:01.320 --> 00:40:04.130
I don't believe you, but you can tell me

00:40:04.130 --> 00:40:05.900
stories about the future, like last night.

00:40:06.590 --> 00:40:07.970
The topic of today's lesson.

00:40:26.180 --> 00:40:27.490
Constitutional monarchy.

00:40:28.920 --> 00:40:30.320
Constitutional monarchy?

00:40:30.650 --> 00:40:32.680
There are monarchs, but they do not rule the people.

00:40:33.990 --> 00:40:37.090
The ruler exists, but the people also have power.

00:40:40.030 --> 00:40:41.490
There is a country called Bhutan.

00:40:41.900 --> 00:40:43.630
A strange name for a country.

00:40:43.860 --> 00:40:46.670
There is a king with an even stranger name, Jigme Khesar.

00:40:46.970 --> 00:40:49.430
Previously, there was an absolute monarchy, like in Joseon.

00:40:49.430 --> 00:40:51.110
But he changed it to a constitutional monarchy.

00:40:51.510 --> 00:40:52.610
For what?

00:40:53.110 --> 00:40:55.840
He was afraid that a tyrant might ascend the throne,

00:40:55.840 --> 00:40:57.280
who will destroy the country.

00:40:57.920 --> 00:41:00.180
Therefore, he introduced a constitutional system.

00:41:00.450 --> 00:41:02.090
He rules the country based on the law.

00:41:02.220 --> 00:41:04.260
So the kingdom is just a symbol.

00:41:04.680 --> 00:41:07.180
Jigme Khesar is smart.

00:41:08.220 --> 00:41:10.490
What Chinese character did he use to write "Ji"?

00:41:28.900 --> 00:41:31.450
It's time to go home.

00:41:32.740 --> 00:41:33.780
Going home?

00:41:34.880 --> 00:41:35.920
Where is it?

00:41:35.920 --> 00:41:40.180
My friend, you've had too much to drink.

00:41:40.180 --> 00:41:41.630
I forgot where your house is.

00:41:42.680 --> 00:41:45.030
You know what? I've had enough.

00:41:45.030 --> 00:41:48.200
I need to go home and rest.

00:41:56.170 --> 00:41:57.740
I don't have a home.

00:42:00.700 --> 00:42:02.150
I have nothing.

00:42:05.610 --> 00:42:09.340
I have nowhere to go, I have nothing.

00:42:11.680 --> 00:42:13.990
I have absolutely nothing.

00:42:29.240 --> 00:42:33.570
I liked you
not only because of the meeting at the well

00:42:33.570 --> 00:42:35.510
eight years ago.

00:42:37.280 --> 00:42:38.320
No.

00:42:40.010 --> 00:42:41.780
He couldn't find out the truth.

00:42:52.860 --> 00:42:55.090
You cannot enter.

00:42:55.090 --> 00:42:56.590
I must see the king.

00:42:57.340 --> 00:42:59.200
Well...

00:43:04.700 --> 00:43:06.930
Your Majesty, this is Hwajin.

00:43:45.570 --> 00:43:47.920
So you want

00:43:47.920 --> 00:43:50.220
so that I finish the book on tactics with the queen,

00:43:50.490 --> 00:43:52.260
dressed as a man.

00:43:53.780 --> 00:43:55.030
Fabulous.

00:43:56.880 --> 00:43:58.220
Drop your prejudices.

00:43:58.400 --> 00:43:59.650
She creates weapons

00:43:59.650 --> 00:44:01.490
which no one has ever seen before.

00:44:03.970 --> 00:44:06.570
Well, let's listen.

00:44:07.610 --> 00:44:10.880
Before that, let's talk about the lethal method of training soldiers.

00:44:11.180 --> 00:44:12.840
Why not start with this?

00:44:14.950 --> 00:44:16.050
Killer method?

00:44:18.920 --> 00:44:21.420
1, 2, 3.

00:44:21.680 --> 00:44:22.720
Seven.

00:44:22.720 --> 00:44:26.260
I can't hear you. Is that all you can do?

00:44:27.090 --> 00:44:30.180
Okay, I understand everything. Let's talk about weapons.

00:44:30.550 --> 00:44:32.990
There are 14 approaches in total. This is the 8th.

00:44:34.970 --> 00:44:37.090
Don't mention the last number.

00:44:37.300 --> 00:44:39.860
You name it and you start again.

00:44:41.260 --> 00:44:43.570
1, 2, 3.

00:44:43.900 --> 00:44:44.900
Six.

00:44:45.700 --> 00:44:46.970
1, 2, 3.

00:44:46.970 --> 00:44:48.900
-Look straight.
-Seven.

00:44:49.070 --> 00:44:51.610
It is dangerous to allow it into military strategy.

00:44:51.920 --> 00:44:54.820
The queen declared war on her clan.

00:44:55.780 --> 00:44:58.380
She no longer needs to prove that she is for us.

00:45:01.090 --> 00:45:02.180
Your Majesty.

00:45:02.180 --> 00:45:04.860
-Raise your legs.
-2, 3.

00:45:05.130 --> 00:45:06.490
-Eight.
-Past.

00:45:07.260 --> 00:45:08.760
Eight is the last number.

00:45:09.320 --> 00:45:11.090
Start again.

00:45:11.090 --> 00:45:12.860
Wait. This killer method

00:45:12.860 --> 00:45:14.510
will it end when I die?

00:45:14.510 --> 00:45:16.200
Start again.

00:45:16.700 --> 00:45:18.010
-Let's.
-One.

00:45:19.030 --> 00:45:20.280
Your Majesty.

00:45:32.320 --> 00:45:34.130
Slowly turning into a monster -

00:45:37.530 --> 00:45:39.590
and you yourself don’t notice.

00:45:50.130 --> 00:45:51.700
This fake entry

00:45:51.700 --> 00:45:54.010
enough to remove the left advisor.

00:45:54.840 --> 00:45:57.200
-Take care of him.
-Yes.

00:46:00.180 --> 00:46:03.050
Your Majesty, the main concubine has arrived.

00:46:03.820 --> 00:46:04.990
Let me in.

00:46:16.860 --> 00:46:18.400
I need to tell you something.

00:46:20.840 --> 00:46:23.930
Prince Yeonpyeong, could you please leave us?

00:46:24.610 --> 00:46:26.630
-Your Highness.
-Please.

00:46:36.110 --> 00:46:39.880
Lately you have often been talking to the Queen in the evenings.

00:46:41.050 --> 00:46:42.990
May I know what you discussed?

00:46:43.360 --> 00:46:45.900
We talked about how I see the future of Joseon.

00:46:47.800 --> 00:46:51.090
I thought that I would be the only one with whom you would share your dreams.

00:46:52.300 --> 00:46:53.590
While the queen was getting closer to you,

00:46:53.590 --> 00:46:57.130
all I did was hesitate because of someone else's lies.

00:47:00.900 --> 00:47:03.010
But I won't let this happen anymore.

00:47:05.150 --> 00:47:06.780
Initial Instruction for Children

00:47:08.510 --> 00:47:09.880
not mine.

00:47:15.150 --> 00:47:16.680
You already knew about this.

00:47:17.950 --> 00:47:20.200
Then why didn't they say anything?

00:47:20.530 --> 00:47:22.570
Because it won't change anything.

00:47:22.570 --> 00:47:24.740
Why won't this change anything?

00:47:26.130 --> 00:47:29.240
You don't trust me anymore.

00:47:30.900 --> 00:47:34.010
You don't look at me the same way anymore.

00:47:34.380 --> 00:47:36.800
Because of one single lie

00:47:37.380 --> 00:47:40.110
the time spent with you will not disappear.

00:47:41.680 --> 00:47:44.010
The fact that I loved you for two years

00:47:45.150 --> 00:47:46.320
will not change.

00:47:46.680 --> 00:47:48.680
I'm sure you did this for my sake.

00:47:50.930 --> 00:47:52.820
Because that's the kind of person you are.

00:47:54.800 --> 00:47:57.360
Do you think the fact will make me happy?

00:47:57.700 --> 00:47:59.740
that you pretended not to know anything?

00:47:59.740 --> 00:48:02.700
-Hwajin.
-I framed the queen.

00:48:04.280 --> 00:48:05.400
I

00:48:06.530 --> 00:48:08.240
I found the Kim clan record book

00:48:08.240 --> 00:48:09.950
and gave it to the Queen Mother.

00:48:11.550 --> 00:48:12.610
Why are you...

00:48:14.380 --> 00:48:15.550
Because

00:48:17.680 --> 00:48:18.990
I hate the queen.

00:48:20.110 --> 00:48:22.320
Did you know that this ledger

00:48:23.150 --> 00:48:25.150
was it absolutely necessary for me?

00:48:25.320 --> 00:48:26.800
She knew, but she gave it away.

00:48:29.090 --> 00:48:31.470
How could you do this?

00:48:32.170 --> 00:48:34.840
You knew better than anyone what I dreamed about.

00:48:36.130 --> 00:48:37.630
You trampled my dreams.

00:48:37.630 --> 00:48:38.900
My dream...

00:48:39.780 --> 00:48:41.880
You were my dream.

00:48:43.400 --> 00:48:46.920
But your heart began to beat for the queen.

00:48:48.240 --> 00:48:50.420
You tried so hard for me

00:48:51.180 --> 00:48:53.920
but I saw how you were drawn to her.

00:48:55.630 --> 00:48:58.360
I felt so pathetic.

00:49:01.320 --> 00:49:03.470
That's how I lost myself.

00:49:17.450 --> 00:49:18.720
It's my fault.

00:49:20.780 --> 00:49:22.490
You became like this because of me.

00:49:24.050 --> 00:49:25.680
It's my fault.

00:49:27.420 --> 00:49:31.050
I shouldn't have loved without taking care of myself.

00:49:34.970 --> 00:49:36.320
I'll go

00:49:37.860 --> 00:49:39.400
and find myself.

00:49:53.280 --> 00:49:54.610
"The World of the Married. Volume 1"

00:49:54.610 --> 00:49:56.490
What a bastard!

00:49:57.650 --> 00:49:58.720
Next.

00:49:59.950 --> 00:50:01.180
"The World of the Married. Volume 2"

00:50:03.450 --> 00:50:07.930
Your Majesty, will you not go to the Hijeongjong Hall today?

00:50:08.570 --> 00:50:09.990
Maybe skip today?

00:50:13.070 --> 00:50:16.030
My Cheoljong will be desperately waiting for my arrival.

00:50:19.570 --> 00:50:22.650
Who would have thought
that I have such a thirst for knowledge.

00:50:23.780 --> 00:50:25.110
One more page.

00:50:36.360 --> 00:50:39.400
Kim Soyeon

00:50:42.470 --> 00:50:45.990
Cheoljong, sorry, sorry. I only wanted to read one page

00:50:45.990 --> 00:50:47.490
but couldn't stop.

00:50:48.240 --> 00:50:49.700
Why haven't you changed your clothes yet?

00:50:58.380 --> 00:51:01.490
What? Why are you giving it to me?

00:51:02.180 --> 00:51:06.720
Didn't you tell me to return her to you if I want to live?

00:51:12.590 --> 00:51:17.320
You can hurt someone without knowing the truth.

00:51:18.470 --> 00:51:20.360
I've been waiting a long time

00:51:20.990 --> 00:51:22.800
to return the book to its owner.

00:51:32.240 --> 00:51:33.680
I'm sorry

00:51:34.880 --> 00:51:36.550
that I didn't recognize you.

00:51:39.360 --> 00:51:40.720
And you me.

00:51:42.180 --> 00:51:44.650
I wasn't honest with you.

00:51:47.050 --> 00:51:49.220
She returned to the owner after 8 years.

00:51:49.990 --> 00:51:53.130
We cannot get back our lost time.

00:51:55.400 --> 00:51:56.970
However

00:51:58.380 --> 00:52:01.200
I will never leave you again.

00:52:07.110 --> 00:52:10.590
But how did you live

00:52:11.010 --> 00:52:13.650
all these eight years?

00:52:14.820 --> 00:52:18.800
You were strange back then, but not that much.

00:52:19.360 --> 00:52:21.220
Did I miss something?

00:52:23.300 --> 00:52:24.590
Good question.

00:52:40.890 --> 00:52:42.760
Looks good, although I don't know what it is.

00:52:45.030 --> 00:52:46.260
This is medicine.

00:52:47.500 --> 00:52:49.700
Whatever you eat in secret should be delicious.

00:52:51.700 --> 00:52:52.840
Yogurt?

00:52:54.340 --> 00:52:56.370
-Smells like alcohol.
-Well, this...

00:52:57.640 --> 00:52:58.910
This is pear wine.

00:52:59.140 --> 00:53:01.040
Made from pear flowers

00:53:01.040 --> 00:53:04.820
and drink when the scent of flowers swirls in the air.

00:53:05.820 --> 00:53:06.980
Will you pour a glass?

00:53:07.150 --> 00:53:08.650
I only have one left.

00:53:08.650 --> 00:53:11.660
It takes a lot of effort to create, so I kept it.

00:53:11.660 --> 00:53:13.160
-But because of you...
- Damn.

00:53:15.430 --> 00:53:16.730
How did you make it?

00:53:17.660 --> 00:53:21.300
First, prepare the dough by mixing water with low-fat rice powder.

00:53:21.300 --> 00:53:24.030
Then flatten the dough and make a hole.

00:53:24.030 --> 00:53:25.800
We make the preparation.

00:53:27.910 --> 00:53:29.340
Looks like a donut.

00:53:32.680 --> 00:53:33.680
Continue.

00:53:33.680 --> 00:53:36.950
So, boil it in hot water, take it out,

00:53:36.950 --> 00:53:39.080
knead and let cool.

00:53:39.880 --> 00:53:42.820
Take pear flowers and pre-prepared yeast

00:53:42.820 --> 00:53:44.560
and make the dough again.

00:53:44.820 --> 00:53:48.590
Place it in a jug and close the lid.

00:53:48.590 --> 00:53:50.960
In three days...

00:53:50.960 --> 00:53:52.100
Can I drink?

00:53:54.630 --> 00:53:55.970
Of course not.

00:53:56.430 --> 00:53:59.670
You shake it up.

00:53:59.670 --> 00:54:01.470
And after 20 days

00:54:02.470 --> 00:54:04.110
You can already drink.

00:54:06.610 --> 00:54:08.210
Let the time fly by.

00:54:08.880 --> 00:54:10.610
Insist quickly.

00:54:16.320 --> 00:54:17.890
Left Advisor Kim Seok-keun

00:54:17.890 --> 00:54:19.460
together with local officials

00:54:19.460 --> 00:54:23.160
misused farmers' labor and falsified records.

00:54:23.160 --> 00:54:24.760
In connection with theft charges

00:54:24.760 --> 00:54:26.360
he will be removed from office,

00:54:26.360 --> 00:54:28.570
and his property will be confiscated.

00:54:28.800 --> 00:54:30.400
How dare you!

00:54:32.970 --> 00:54:35.440
Don't come. Let me go!

00:54:35.840 --> 00:54:37.710
Let go!

00:54:39.140 --> 00:54:40.440
Hands off!

00:54:45.620 --> 00:54:49.120
I had no idea that the Queen's warning was not a farce.

00:54:50.320 --> 00:54:52.360
In place of the left adviser

00:54:52.660 --> 00:54:54.990
I appoint Concubine Min's father,

00:54:54.990 --> 00:54:57.290
Min Ujina from the Yohyn clan Min.

00:54:57.290 --> 00:54:59.100
Reconsider your decision.

00:54:59.100 --> 00:55:01.600
-Reconsider your decision.
-Reconsider your decision.

00:55:16.450 --> 00:55:17.880
The conversation will be short.

00:55:19.120 --> 00:55:21.420
When will my regency be restored?

00:55:21.490 --> 00:55:24.660
This must happen before the king destroys Joseon.

00:55:24.820 --> 00:55:28.030
Our family will no longer lose its position.

00:55:28.590 --> 00:55:30.690
Moreover, we are gathering troops,

00:55:30.890 --> 00:55:33.160
so the king does not have long left.

00:55:33.160 --> 00:55:34.430
Hurry up.

00:55:34.430 --> 00:55:36.700
I'm not known for my patience.

00:55:36.970 --> 00:55:38.070
Yes.

00:55:38.570 --> 00:55:42.170
By the way, I heard something strange.

00:55:43.710 --> 00:55:47.240
That the queen is introducing the king to blasphemous ideals.

00:56:00.790 --> 00:56:01.860
On a sleepless night I walk.

00:56:01.860 --> 00:56:02.930
Light breaks through the dark night sky.

00:56:19.610 --> 00:56:21.210
Does she still have it?

00:56:43.700 --> 00:56:45.240
Are they all followers of Tonhak?

00:56:45.800 --> 00:56:46.800
Yes.

00:56:46.800 --> 00:56:50.710
-Come out.
-Mother.

00:56:50.710 --> 00:56:53.110
Why are you taking the child?

00:56:53.410 --> 00:56:55.580
Dream! Dream!

00:57:01.490 --> 00:57:02.990
Do you recognize the handwriting?

00:57:12.460 --> 00:57:15.070
This is the code of the followers of Tonhak.

00:57:21.270 --> 00:57:23.640
In war, all means are good.

00:57:23.640 --> 00:57:24.940
"Funds"? What does it mean?

00:57:25.280 --> 00:57:26.540
Some kind of proverb?

00:57:26.880 --> 00:57:29.780
A grenade can be more effective than 10 soldiers.

00:57:30.150 --> 00:57:32.150
It seems like a fantasy.

00:57:32.150 --> 00:57:33.180
By the way,

00:57:33.350 --> 00:57:36.320
I remembered 15 training sessions here.

00:57:36.490 --> 00:57:39.660
Sounds plausible, "grenade".

00:57:42.260 --> 00:57:44.690
If you put gunpowder in such a bag and throw it,

00:57:44.690 --> 00:57:47.160
it will explode like this.

00:57:48.100 --> 00:57:49.330
We have this.

00:57:49.930 --> 00:57:51.270
Explosive bombs.

00:57:51.870 --> 00:57:54.540
Is it true? Do you have a bulletproof vest?

00:57:55.470 --> 00:57:56.910
Bulletproof clothing?

00:57:57.310 --> 00:57:58.710
Do you mean armor?

00:57:59.240 --> 00:58:01.380
No, he wears it under his armor.

00:58:02.780 --> 00:58:03.850
Here's how.

00:58:05.450 --> 00:58:06.850
Hon!

00:58:08.550 --> 00:58:11.350
I was passing by and the light was on.

00:58:11.960 --> 00:58:13.420
Glad to see you.

00:58:15.160 --> 00:58:18.300
Yes, you are having fun here without me.

00:58:18.600 --> 00:58:20.500
I can't believe I wasn't invited.

00:58:25.070 --> 00:58:26.240
- Well, what are you doing?
-God!

00:58:26.800 --> 00:58:27.970
Lee Senman!

00:58:28.570 --> 00:58:30.610
Alive!

00:58:33.380 --> 00:58:35.110
How worried I was.

00:58:36.450 --> 00:58:38.680
We finally met. Really!

00:58:40.850 --> 00:58:43.190
I'm glad to meet you too.

00:58:43.190 --> 00:58:45.620
Never returned to Oktajeong?

00:58:45.620 --> 00:58:47.120
I drank so much wine

00:58:47.120 --> 00:58:50.330
there, hoping to meet you.

00:58:50.860 --> 00:58:52.130
Lee Senman!

00:58:58.000 --> 00:59:01.100
Hands off. Maybe you could introduce yourself first?

00:59:01.770 --> 00:59:03.340
Who are you?

00:59:03.510 --> 00:59:07.080
I am a close friend of Lee Saengman.

00:59:07.940 --> 00:59:10.080
"Friend"? I...

00:59:10.710 --> 00:59:12.980
-Your...
-I...

00:59:14.550 --> 00:59:17.050
Wait a minute. The face is somewhat familiar.

00:59:18.390 --> 00:59:20.920
My friend, Jeon Chul.

00:59:21.160 --> 00:59:22.230
Why...

00:59:23.360 --> 00:59:24.930
Who are you then?

00:59:25.460 --> 00:59:26.700
I'm Jeong Chul.

00:59:30.230 --> 00:59:33.470
Eat! Victory!

00:59:35.310 --> 00:59:38.440
What do you need to do to play like this?

00:59:39.880 --> 00:59:41.780
Let's say, wasted youth.

00:59:42.350 --> 00:59:43.980
Exactly my friend.

00:59:44.280 --> 00:59:46.350
We are so similar.

00:59:46.350 --> 00:59:49.290
God, this looks like a good place.

00:59:49.720 --> 00:59:51.690
Maybe you're hiding the cards somewhere?

00:59:52.020 --> 00:59:54.490
It's hard to get a trump card.

00:59:54.490 --> 00:59:55.930
Don't blame yourself for your mistake

00:59:55.930 --> 00:59:57.590
my luck.

00:59:57.930 --> 00:59:59.560
Well, let's move on.

00:59:59.930 --> 01:00:02.070
Losers get their wish granted.

01:00:05.800 --> 01:00:07.540
Watch your hat.

01:00:08.440 --> 01:00:09.570
Insider.

01:00:12.710 --> 01:00:13.740
Outsider.

01:00:15.610 --> 01:00:18.110
And a stickler for his beliefs, like me.

01:00:18.780 --> 01:00:20.250
What a union.

01:00:37.630 --> 01:00:38.870
I'll help.

01:00:43.070 --> 01:00:44.610
All thanks to noltvigi.

01:00:47.710 --> 01:00:49.180
I am confident of my victory.

01:01:13.340 --> 01:01:15.970
I can't believe they used this

01:01:15.970 --> 01:01:18.240
to shift the left advisor.

01:01:19.810 --> 01:01:24.280
So... I'm sure they have the ledger.

01:01:25.550 --> 01:01:27.680
Now the real battle will begin.

01:01:28.250 --> 01:01:29.250
What?

01:01:30.650 --> 01:01:33.290
Let's start cleaning up before the bloodshed.

01:01:34.590 --> 01:01:36.560
If you don't want to get bogged down in this,

01:01:37.090 --> 01:01:40.700
put aside your greed and prepare to shed blood.

01:01:41.560 --> 01:01:42.870
Spill blood?

01:01:44.800 --> 01:01:47.270
Those who sold government jobs

01:01:47.270 --> 01:01:49.470
will resign of their own free will.

01:01:51.040 --> 01:01:52.310
If you got rich from grain

01:01:52.310 --> 01:01:53.540
or on gifts,

01:01:53.540 --> 01:01:54.840
return everything.

01:01:56.310 --> 01:01:58.310
And take care of those

01:01:59.220 --> 01:02:02.620
who kept all the records and knew about everything.

01:02:02.620 --> 01:02:03.620
Suicide letter

01:02:03.620 --> 01:02:04.690
The one

01:02:06.720 --> 01:02:09.730
who doesn’t clean up after himself and leaves traces,

01:02:11.460 --> 01:02:13.830
must answer for everything.

01:02:18.570 --> 01:02:20.670
Even though I overthrew the Kim clan,

01:02:20.670 --> 01:02:22.710
Kim Byonin's power only grew stronger.

01:02:23.340 --> 01:02:25.640
It feels like there is no progress.

01:02:25.640 --> 01:02:27.710
We need to find something on Kim Byungin.

01:02:28.550 --> 01:02:31.050
Looks like he helped someone with the civil service,

01:02:31.050 --> 01:02:34.220
but he can't be caught if he doesn't get anything in return.

01:02:34.220 --> 01:02:37.720
And it doesn't look like this at all.

01:02:40.720 --> 01:02:42.860
And those whom he helped

01:02:42.860 --> 01:02:44.430
very grateful to him

01:02:45.360 --> 01:02:46.930
we can't lure them away.

01:02:46.930 --> 01:02:49.200
He built an invincible fortress.

01:02:58.410 --> 01:02:59.710
You are already here.

01:03:01.910 --> 01:03:03.310
Isn't Lee Saengman there yet?

01:03:04.550 --> 01:03:05.620
Oh wait.

01:03:06.350 --> 01:03:09.020
I have to say, he is so diligent.

01:03:09.520 --> 01:03:11.590
Every day he comes to play with us in the tudzhon.

01:03:15.460 --> 01:03:16.990
Don't you have a job?

01:03:17.230 --> 01:03:18.600
This is my job.

01:03:19.130 --> 01:03:20.960
How can this be work?

01:03:21.760 --> 01:03:23.630
Hey, I asked.

01:03:40.650 --> 01:03:44.820
Today it's like you're mine

01:03:44.820 --> 01:03:49.130
but you're not mine.

01:04:24.330 --> 01:04:25.900
Greetings.

01:04:33.940 --> 01:04:39.610
I came to complain about the queen.

01:04:39.610 --> 01:04:41.140
Yes, me too.

01:04:42.250 --> 01:04:43.780
Well, you begin.

01:04:45.220 --> 01:04:46.220
Fine.

01:04:49.950 --> 01:04:52.290
Your Majesty!

01:04:52.760 --> 01:04:56.760
Stop making me angry!

01:05:02.300 --> 01:05:06.100
If you continue, your face will rattle in manure.

01:05:08.840 --> 01:05:09.910
Oh, darling.

01:05:10.770 --> 01:05:13.380
It's rare to meet someone who swears worse than me.

01:05:13.780 --> 01:05:16.380
But let me give you some advice. If you exhale from here...

01:05:17.750 --> 01:05:19.150
How awkward.

01:05:20.920 --> 01:05:23.320
-Well, it’s time for me to warm up too.
-Fine.

01:05:25.320 --> 01:05:28.220
You piece... You're driving me crazy.

01:05:33.160 --> 01:05:34.330
Here I will ask you!

01:05:39.400 --> 01:05:40.400
God.

01:05:43.470 --> 01:05:45.440
-Maybe together?
-Certainly.

01:05:47.610 --> 01:05:49.580
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

01:06:08.400 --> 01:06:11.070
I love you, my wine!

01:06:11.070 --> 01:06:13.600
You are wonderful, my wine!

01:06:15.370 --> 01:06:17.170
Like this.

01:06:17.170 --> 01:06:18.610
You try it too.

01:06:19.180 --> 01:06:21.210
On the bottom. Here you go.

01:06:24.750 --> 01:06:25.820
And you too.

01:06:26.980 --> 01:06:28.950
What a beautiful color, queen.

01:06:29.320 --> 01:06:31.190
And such a delicious aroma.

01:06:32.490 --> 01:06:34.890
It's brewed. Perfect exposure.

01:06:35.790 --> 01:06:39.100
What did you both do that lost your voices?

01:06:45.200 --> 01:06:46.500
Let's see.

01:06:49.240 --> 01:06:51.140
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty.

01:06:51.210 --> 01:06:52.780
Is it because I haven't eaten anything?

01:06:53.980 --> 01:06:59.350
Then it'll be for dessert!

01:06:59.880 --> 01:07:02.490
I will return to you, my wine!

01:07:02.490 --> 01:07:05.890
My wonderful wine!

01:07:09.030 --> 01:07:10.290
From the petals of blooming pears.

01:07:11.290 --> 01:07:14.130
I came running here because I wanted to give this to you in person.

01:07:14.630 --> 01:07:16.370
Finally the book is ready.

01:07:23.040 --> 01:07:24.240
"Handbook of Military Training"?

01:07:24.910 --> 01:07:26.140
Good name.

01:07:26.310 --> 01:07:27.610
All thanks to you.

01:07:28.580 --> 01:07:30.750
Yes, I just told you what I saw.

01:07:32.980 --> 01:07:34.280
On the next page.

01:07:35.420 --> 01:07:36.620
On that day, Councilor Hon...

01:07:38.520 --> 01:07:41.920
He becomes incontinent every time he sees these drawings.

01:07:43.260 --> 01:07:45.260
Yes, the drawings here look great.

01:07:49.530 --> 01:07:50.630
My queen.

01:07:52.570 --> 01:07:54.000
Aren't you lonely?

01:07:57.770 --> 01:08:00.440
I didn't live long as a commoner, but still

01:08:01.340 --> 01:08:03.210
struggled with loneliness

01:08:03.210 --> 01:08:05.050
and it was hard for me to adjust,
when I got here.

01:08:06.920 --> 01:08:09.850
But you're so unusual
you must be even more lonely.

01:08:10.490 --> 01:08:11.950
I'm worried.

01:08:12.690 --> 01:08:14.460
I don't have time to be alone.

01:08:14.660 --> 01:08:17.230
Difficulties every day and running around.

01:08:28.170 --> 01:08:31.210
Someone even started a dictionary to understand me better.

01:08:31.810 --> 01:08:33.780
Thanks to him I don’t feel lonely at all.

01:08:47.390 --> 01:08:48.720
Is it time for ramen?

01:08:52.130 --> 01:08:54.300
Should I say it or not?

01:08:54.660 --> 01:08:55.800
God!

01:09:00.870 --> 01:09:03.270
It's not on purpose. I feel sick.

01:09:06.310 --> 01:09:09.480
Call the royal physician immediately.

01:09:42.780 --> 01:09:44.180
Something serious?

01:09:47.450 --> 01:09:49.150
The Queen is pregnant.

01:09:52.120 --> 01:09:53.520
What? Pregnant?

01:09:56.360 --> 01:09:57.530
I am pregnant?

01:10:01.260 --> 01:10:03.770
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

01:10:10.210 --> 01:10:11.570
My queen, thank you.

01:10:20.480 --> 01:10:23.650
-Congratulations, Your Majesty!
-Congratulations, Your Majesty!

01:10:26.460 --> 01:10:28.560
I will become a father!

01:10:49.480 --> 01:10:50.680
I

01:10:52.980 --> 01:10:54.780
pregnant?

01:10:59.490 --> 01:11:03.760
How I became queen

01:11:23.550 --> 01:11:25.820
Am I pregnant?

01:11:25.820 --> 01:11:28.950
Today the real school for pregnant women starts.

01:11:28.950 --> 01:11:31.790
You should avoid such unusual dishes.

01:11:31.790 --> 01:11:34.690
I assume you spread the rumors as I instructed?

01:11:34.690 --> 01:11:36.290
They didn't actually sleep together.

01:11:36.290 --> 01:11:38.460
What's wrong with the pose? How awkward.

01:11:38.460 --> 01:11:40.330
This is not enough to quell the rumors.

01:11:40.330 --> 01:11:41.760
If you say so...

01:11:41.830 --> 01:11:44.070
What everyone believes becomes true.

01:11:44.070 --> 01:11:46.600
First bring me the queen's head.

01:11:46.600 --> 01:11:47.970
This is an order.

01:11:47.970 --> 01:11:50.240
If I want to live, everyone around me will die.

01:11:50.240 --> 01:11:51.840
So, I will accept everything.
